/-!
# Incident-pair representatives for the binary SL₅ adjoint map

The 65 matrices below are representatives for the incident vector–covector
pairs used in the construction. The first twenty image vectors correspond
to Eᵢⱼ (i ≠ j); the last four are sums representing Eᵢᵢ + E₄₄.
`actionIndices` records conjugation by four adjacent exchanges and E₀₁ + I.
These are data, checked against the local relations in `Geometry` and
against literal matrix conjugation in `Coordinates`.

Source: GM, *Classification of 2F-modules, II*, Lemma 4.5 step 2.
The reproducible generator is retained under `Cyclic/source/`.
-/

set_option backward.isDefEq.respectTransparency false
@[expose] public section
